  m_Name: Slide_04_Story2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Project.Runtime::DumyatRuntime.TextSlideSO
  _sectionNumber: 3
  _sectionName: Game Story
  _title: Two things carry it
  _kicker: Both built, both playable
  _speakerNotes: "\"Out loud\" is the part people do not expect. Pause on it.\nDo
    NOT demo the merchant here \u2014 that is section 6."
  _background: {fileID: 0}
  _transitionIn: {fileID: 0}
  _layout: 2
  _body: "Carpentry, where the tools behave like tools and every cut leaves you holding
    two real pieces of wood. And the fish market, where you haggle out loud in Egyptian
    Arabic with a merchant who answers in character \u2014 while ordinary C# quietly
    keeps the money honest."
